<devicesets>
<deviceset name="WE-HCIM_110407" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:54432711/1" prefix="L">
<description>WE-HCIM High-Current Molded Inductor for Multiphase Applications

Characteristics
Low inductance: &lt;100 nH
Low DC resistance of &lt;0.3 mΩ
High saturation current of 67–130 A
High-frequency capability: self-resonant frequency up to 300 MHz
Core material: iron alloy
High efficiency for demanding, high-current applications
Flexible design options: suitable for single, double, 2×2 matrix, and TLVR topologies
Operating temperature up to 155 °C

Applications
Multiphase VRM for CPUs/GPUs/AI accelerators
Data center servers and high-performance computing (HPC) platforms
AI chip Power Delivery Networks (PDN)
High Power ASIC applications
Laptop/notebook power supplies
Power modules for high-end semiconductor/chipset manufacturers
5 G PMUs due to its ability to operate at very high frequencies

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-HCIM

Created by Ella 2026-10-20
2026 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
